00:47:05.920 --> 00:47:11.520
commodities can be useful, but they can

00:47:08.880 --> 00:47:13.760
also be extremely volatile. My honest

00:47:11.520 --> 00:47:16.319
take is that a small allocation to gold

00:47:13.760 --> 00:47:18.800
