00:47:16.319 --> 00:47:21.680
you understand why you own it and what

00:47:18.800 --> 00:47:23.280
role it's playing in your portfolio, but

00:47:21.680 --> 00:47:25.680
I wouldn't build my entire wealth

00:47:23.280 --> 00:47:27.920
